WEBVTT

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:28.970
W-who?

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:30.310
Who is she?

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:34.200
Nee-chan?

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:36.310
Yuzuyu.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.460
Yuzuyu?

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:40.610
You take care of her!

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:43.790
Oh yeah.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:46.170
We decided to have her live here.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.890
Nee-chan told me to look after her.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.060
So I took care of her...

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.500
and then she slept here with me...

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:58.170
and then...

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:22.960
Mother!

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.020
Kippei! What is it?

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:26.550
I have a favor to ask.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.790
What are you planning to do to your mother?

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:31.120
Teach me how to make rice balls.

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:34.790
Rice... balls?

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:40.590
How to make rice balls?

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:44.210
Well, all you do is take it and mold it like this.

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:45.920
Okay, I've got it.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.170
You can go now.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:51.730
That's my favorite apron, so don't get it dirty, okay?

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.250
Ouch, that's hot!

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.990
Good morning.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:03:59.330
Oh no, it's Nee-chan.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.370
What are you doing Kippei?

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:06.830
Oh, is it Kippei's turn to make breakfast today?

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:08.440
I hope not!

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:11.010
I'm not going to eat that thing.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:13.670
Who asked you to eat it?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:17.120
Anyway, can you even make anything fit for human consumption?

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:18.890
What? Rice balls?

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:22.320
Hey! I never said you could look, you weirdo!

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:27.070
Anyway... could this be Yuzuyu-chan's lunch?

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:31.920
You're being so nice to that girl.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:35.010
You're the one that told me to take care of her!

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:39.660
I'm awake.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.860
Yuzuyu-chan, he's making your lunch.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.370
Hey! Don't tell her.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:58.220
Mine?

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.430
So, if you could go get ready...

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:04.590
Okay.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.220
Kippei, you're just like a mom.

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:16.190
She sure is a good girl, isn't she?

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:21.210
Aunt Miyako should hurry back here for her.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:45.090
Here you go.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:46.400
Thank you!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.840
Oh, Satsuki-onii-chan...

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:53.730
Yeah?

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.810
Does Kippei-onii-chan have a girlfriend?

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.980
Girlfriend.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:07.680
I don't know. I don't think he has a girlfriend.

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:09.000
Yay!

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:14.680
Well then, I'm going to marry Kippei-onii-chan.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.020
Shh!

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:19.670
It's a secret!

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:26.490
Hey everyone, this five year old child has just made a life-threatening decision.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.110
Tada!

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.320
Here's your lunch.

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:39.040
Yay!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.190
Kippei-mama, you're going to be late!

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:47.930
Eek! It's that time already?

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:49.250
We have to hurry!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.590
I'm going.

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:52.530
Have a good day.

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:53.640
Rice...

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:54.600
rice...

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.620
ball...

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:58.760
rice ball.

00:06:59.130 --> 00:06:59.770
Rice...

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:00.690
rice...

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:02.890
ball...

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:04.870
Let's hurry or we'll be late!
Rice ball!

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:07.130
Okay! I'll hurry!

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:08.420
Rice,

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:09.870
ball, ball...

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.280
rice ball.

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:12.680
Rice, rice...

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:14.040
ball, ball...

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:15.530
Rice ball.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.330
Aikawa Hidenbou.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.260
Here!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.140
Okamoto Shoko.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:20.950
Here!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.860
Katakura Kippei.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.420
He's late again today? Geez.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.860
Kippei was late yesterday too.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:34.360
He seems so busy, maybe he did get a girlfriend.

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:41.160
Hey, Katakura, you're late!

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:44.240
Sensei.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:45.840
W-what is it?

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.740
I know I was late again today...

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:52.720
but I'm filled with a very happy feeling.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:53.930
Is that so?

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:57.420
What do you mean, "Is that so?"

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:59.370
Just hurry up and take your seat!

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:02.460
The teacher has already given up on Kippei.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:04.240
That's because he's an idiot.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:14.980
Ma'am, could I get these?

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:17.940
You're eating bread again today?

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:19.990
Eat some rice! Aren't you Japanese?

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.400
It's fine, I like bread!

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.490
Oh, give me a strawberry milk too.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:35.730
What?

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:38.200
What are you looking at Kippei?

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:41.730
Why are girls' lunches so flashy?

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:43.360
Do you like those?

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:44.740
Do they make you happy?

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:49.690
Hey! Are you mocking the lunch my mother made for me?

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.100
Of course it makes me happy!

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:55.300
What about a rice ball?

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:57.260
One rice ball?

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.720
What's wrong with you?

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.240
I don't really understand you.

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:04.690
Just one rice ball?

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:05.760
With no side dishes?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:07.470
Go die!

00:09:08.390 --> 00:09:09.830
D-die...

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:13.360
I used to have rice balls with no side dishes.

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:15.180
It made me feel so depressed all afternoon.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.510
That brings back memories.

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:19.930
Depressed?

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:23.380
You couldn't even call it a lunch.

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:25.300
I don't believe it.

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.550
I gave her a plain rice ball for lunch.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:31.130
There weren't even any side dishes.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:32.970
I was so proud of myself.

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:34.770
What is...

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.090
What's wrong?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.100
It's nothing.

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:44.780
Wow! Tokunaga, your lunch box is tiny!

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:47.340
Kokoro, you make your lunch yourself, right?

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:49.410
Is this all you eat?

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:50.930
Don't you get hungry?

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.800
Even after five of these rolls I'm not full.

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:55.860
She's not like you!

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:57.330
So you can't make comparisons like that.

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:00.610
Wow, your arms are so thin.

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:03.600
I like girls to have more meat on their bones.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:04.660
Shut up!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.990
I didn't ask about your taste in women.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:08.210
Ouch!

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:11.940
Well, you do have a tiny appetite, that's for sure.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:14.740
You really should eat more.

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:24.570
Sensei, thank you for the meal.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:28.060
Everyone, thank you for the meal.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:33.720
Okay everyone, don't forget to chew your food.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.340
Yes!

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:39.410
Yuzuyu-chan also has a homemade lunch today.

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:40.380
Yeah!

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:41.450
Yuzu's...

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:49.650
...rice ball.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:58.100
What's that?

00:10:58.480 --> 00:10:59.830
It's shaped funny!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.820
Yuzuyu-chan, can you even eat that?

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:06.120
It looks gross.

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:09.140
What's wrong everyone?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:11.060
Let's be quiet and eat.

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:50.670
Sensei, what is it?

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:55.140
If you see Katakura, please tell him to bring me the printouts.

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:56.670
Okay.

00:11:58.760 --> 00:11:59.910
Where is Kippei?

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:02.170
Probably up on the roof.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:03.670
Should we go tell him?

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:07.870
I don't want to get up just for Kippei.

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:10.220
Kokoro, you go get him.

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:11.060
Huh?

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.090
I don't want to get up either.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.460
Come on...

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:38.080
Yay!

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:39.460
Rice...

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:40.360
rice...

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.530
ball...

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:44.500
rice ball.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:45.660
Rice...

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:49.250
She seemed so happy...

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:53.140
but I only made her one rice ball.

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:03.180
I want to eat Mama's rice balls...

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:10.910
but I could never eat them all.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:15.950
So now Mama hates me.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:20.430
I'll be a good girl!

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:23.510
So please take me to my Mama!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.540
I'll make them...

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.330
I'll make your rice balls.

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:51.840
Ah, Kippei!

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.630
So here you are! Let's talk!

00:13:57.070 --> 00:13:58.340
What's wrong?

00:13:58.410 --> 00:13:59.950
You don't seem happy.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.270
Okay, let's hang out today.

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:06.270
Nope, I have plans today.

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:19.090
Stop it.

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:22.400
I'm not in the mood right now.

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:26.550
Oh really? Then what's with your hand?

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:38.930
The teacher wants to see you.

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:40.100
Bye.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.330
I'm sorry, I have to go.

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:53.280
Tokunaga.

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:57.380
Which teacher wanted to talk to me?

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.080
Oh, our homeroom teacher.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.570
Thanks for letting me know.

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:04.010
Don't touch me!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:07.110
Don't think that I'm just another girl you can fool around with.

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:18.950
Even if you say that...

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:22.200
one girl is pretty much the same as the next.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:24.990
Goodbye, Sensei.

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:26.740
Goodbye.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.900
I shouldn't have said that I would make her rice balls.

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:44.210
She's probably angry at me now.

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:47.310
On top of that, Tokunaga was mad at me too.

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:49.480
Ah, what a day!

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:52.950
Katakura-san.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.750
Today, during lunch time...

00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:00.800
Yuzuyu-chan...

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:04.130
slapped one of her friends.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.420
W-what was that?

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:10.500
I will apologize to the parents as well...

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:13.260
but they may say something to you.

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:16.560
Well, kids do fight.

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:14.320
Hmm... What should I say at a time like this?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:17.890
Hey, why did you do such a thing?!

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:19.990
Don't be so sad.

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.380
Well done.

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.670
That's how a woman should be.

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:29.540
It's strange...

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:31.930
something doesn't seem right.

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:46.410
Are you okay?

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:52.960
Well.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.450
Well, well, well...

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:59.560
As you grow up, you're bound to have days like these.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:13.770
Hey, what's wrong?

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:15.210
Did it hurt?

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:16.500
Are you hurt?

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:23.090
Hey, don't cry.

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:26.610
But, Ken-kun...

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:29.810
Ken-kun?

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:31.440
Ken-kun...

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:34.880
said my rice ba...

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:44.220
Ken-kun, what happened?

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:48.110
Yuzuyu-chan hit me.

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:53.870
I didn't do anything...

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:57.880
but Yuzuyu-chan just suddenly hit me.

00:18:58.680 --> 00:18:59.470
Is that right?

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:01.840
Yuzuyu-chan, why did you hit him?

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:10.010
R-Rice ball.

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:14.220
Rice ball?

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:19.290
Ah, was it bad?

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.410
It made me happy.

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:47.550
Don't cry.

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:00.270
Yuzuyu.

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:28.600
I'll try harder tomorrow.

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:36.630
So, what would you like?

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:41.360
Rice balls!

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:44.510
Alright, rice balls it is then.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.040
And a hamburger!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.230
So she did want a side dish.

00:20:56.680 --> 00:21:01.510
Kippei-onii-chan, I really love you!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.600
Yuzuyu is so tiny.

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:22.920
DIE!

00:23:24.720 --> 00:23:25.320
Ouch.

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:28.710
I told you not to lay a finger on her...

00:23:29.320 --> 00:23:31.110
you human trash!

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:35.900
Well, I did touch her, but not in a bad way.

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:38.410
As long as she's female then it's okay?!

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:39.870
You're disgusting!

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:49.880
Okay, Yuzuyu-chan. Let's leave this beast here and go home together.

00:23:51.390 --> 00:23:52.410
Onee-chan...

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:56.370
It's not Onee-chan, it's Onee-sama, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:23:57.390 --> 00:23:58.370
Onee-sama.

00:23:58.940 --> 00:24:04.440
Kippei, go somewhere far away and don't come home for the next three days!

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:08.110
Not that again... geez.

00:24:20.170 --> 00:24:22.130
Yuzuyu, kindergarten is fun, isn't it?

00:24:22.240 --> 00:24:23.190
Y-yeah.

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:26.520
What's wrong? You don't seem very happy.

00:24:26.930 --> 00:24:28.540
N-No, it's not like that.

00:24:28.830 --> 00:24:30.260
I'm doing fine!

00:24:30.790 --> 00:24:31.490
Okay...

00:24:32.290 --> 00:24:33.290
that's alright then.

00:24:34.070 --> 00:24:35.220
Nothing happened.

00:24:35.490 --> 00:24:36.660
I'm not lonely.

00:24:39.020 --> 00:24:40.730
It seems like something is wrong.

00:24:41.940 --> 00:24:43.490
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby...

00:24:43.800 --> 00:24:44.990
Where's Mama?

00:24:45.610 --> 00:24:46.840
Look forward to it!
